 id="cta_button_493380_08de26ea-8796-41b6-a4e0-7f9351d35137" style="" title="DOWNLOAD GUIDE">DOWNLOAD GUIDE</a></span><script charset="utf-8" src="/hs/cta/cta/current.js"></script><script type="text/javascript"> hbspt.cta._relativeUrls=true;hbspt.cta.load(493380, ''''c27d4c31-fe54-406f-aca3-fab27455ab6a'''', {"useNewLoader":"true","region":"na1"}); </script></span><!-- end HubSpot Call-to-Action Code --></span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-2 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_dnd_area-module-2" style=""> <section class="heading-content" id="whyGreenwich"> <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <p style="font-weight:bold;"> </p> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Prepare for a successful business career</p> <p><span>Want to be job-ready as soon as you graduate? Learn high-level skills in marketing, customer service, team development, and project management - and build strong analytical and problem-solving skills to reach your career goals quickly.</span></p> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680705460735" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span7 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Who is this course for?</p> <p>The Certificate IV in Business is designed for students who want to start a successful career in Business in an English-speaking country.</p> <p>This course equips learners with sound business knowledge and extends their skills so that they can learn the basics of successfully contributing in a business. Students will learn to implement customer service strategies and basic leadership skills.</p> <p>Through our expert trainers and real-life case study approach, our graduates are job-ready faster. Our Studio+ programme offers students industry internship placement opportunities.</p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680705460735_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span5 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680690890249" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span6 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;"><span style="color: #000000;">You will learn to</span></p> <p><strong>BSBCRT411</strong> - Apply critical thinking to work practices (Core)<br/><strong>BSBTEC404</strong> - Use digital technologies to collaborate in a work environment (Core)<br/><strong>BSBTWK401</strong> - Build and maintain business relationships (Core)<br/><strong>BSBWHS411</strong> - Implement and monitor WHS policies, procedures and programs (Core)<br/><strong>BSBWRT411</strong> - Write complex documents (Core)<br/><strong>BSBXCM401</strong> - Apply communication strategies in the workplace (Core)<br/><strong>BSBPEF402</strong> - Develop personal work priorities<br/><strong>BSBPEF403</strong> - Lead personal development<br/><strong>BSBCMM411 </strong>- Make presentations<br/><strong>BSBPMG430</strong> - Undertake project work<br/><strong>BSBMKG434</strong> - Promote products and services<br/><strong>BSBOPS404</strong> - Implement customer service strategies<br/><br/><strong>Career Opportunities: </strong><br/>Administrator, Office Coordinator, and Project Officer. </p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680690890249_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span6 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680080789357" style=""> <section class="small-icon-module"> <div class="container"> <div class="small-icon-quick-info"> <div class="heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">You will learn this through</p> </div> <ul class="small-learn-icon"> <li> <p> </p><p>Audio</p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p>presentations</p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p>Social Media</p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p>Role Play</p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p>Online</p> <p></p> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766" style=""> <section class="span12 features-listnew"> <div class="span12 gwcFeatures"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionHead alignCenter heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Why Study Certificate IV in Business at Greenwich College?</p> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid sectioncol"> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-915741300-2.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=836&amp;name=iStock-915741300-2.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Practical skills for real-world success</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Highly qualified trainers with comprehensive industry experience and ongoing professional development – to effectively equip you for a successful career in Business.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-1276435469-2.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=836&amp;name=iStock-1276435469-2.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Practical case studies to strengthen learning</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Greenwich College’s Certificate IV in Business incorporates a comprehensive use of real-life case studies to enhance the learning experience, providing students with valuable insights and practical applications relevant to the Australian business environment.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-999098048.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=836&amp;name=iStock-999098048.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Fun &amp; interactive classes</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Classes are engaging and interactive, incorporating practical activities and providing students with opportunities to share ideas, critically evaluate their thinking, and explore various perspectives on issues.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">More options for further study</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Gain direct entry to leading Australian Universities and Colleges and receive credits towards related study – without having to complete an entry exam.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Flexible timetable options</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Select from weekday evening or weekend classes, allowing you to balance work and immerse yourself in the rich cultural and educational experiences Australia offers while pursuing your studies.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-1276435469-2.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=836&amp;name=iStock-1276435469-2.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Learning &amp; support</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/certificate-4-iv-business?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.8.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Weekly access to supplementary educational support for individuals requiring additional assistance.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680081575766_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-11 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-12 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680688430222" style=""> <section class="span12 need-to-know sectionPadding needtoknow"> <div class="span12 need-to-know gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-header sectionHead"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Here''''s what you need to know</p> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 need-to-know"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <strong>Course Commencement</strong> <p>There are 6 intakes per year.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent1'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent1'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Course Duration</strong><br/>Courses are 40-44 weeks<br/>at 20 hours per week.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent2'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent2'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Entry Requirements</strong><br/>Display entry requirements</p> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-angle-down" id="displayContent3"></i> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent3'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent3'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent1" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent2" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent3" style="display: none;"> <p><strong>Entry Requirement</strong></p> <ul> <li>All students must be 18 years or older at the commencement of their course</li> </ul> <p><strong>English Language Requirement</strong></p> <ul> <li>All students must have a minimum English language proficiency of IELTS 5.5 or equivalent<span> (Please visit Greenwich College Direct Entry Requirements) </span><strong>OR</strong></li> <li>Have successfully completed one of the following courses with Greenwich English College: General English (Upper Intermediate Level 8 weeks*), English for Business (12 weeks), Cambridge PET * FCE <strong>OR</strong> CAE, EVS, EAP <strong>OR</strong> IELTS* (*With exit point of 5.5 or higher)</li> <li>Direct entry to students on passing Greenwich English College Placement Test (online and on campus testing options)</li> </ul> <p><strong>Academic Requirement</strong></p> <ul> <li>Students must have successfully completed Australian Year 10 or overseas equivalent to Australian Year 10</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div> </div> </div> </main> <div data-global-resource-path="greenwich-theme-2023/templates/partials/footer.html"><div class="footer-section"> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_16789435566256" style=""><div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcFooter"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionPaddingSmall alignCenter"> <h4> Your success starts at Greenwich. </h4> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcFtrSitemap"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span3"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;"> Locations </p> <p> </p><p><a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/sydney?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Sydney Pitt St. Campus</strong></a><br/><span>Level 2, 396 Pitt Street</span><br/><span>Sydney NSW 2000 </span><br/><span>+61 2 9264 2223</span></p> <p></p> <p> </p><p><a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/sydney-mary-st?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Sydney Mary St. Campus</strong></a><br/><span>Level 2, 72 Mary Street</span><br/><span>Sydney NSW 2000 </span><br/><span>+61 2 8317 0502</span></p> <p></p> <p> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/melbourne?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Melbourne Campus</strong></a><br/><span>Level 8, 120 Spencer Street</span><br/><span>Melbourne VIC 3000</span><br/><span>+61 3 8609 0000</span> </p> <p> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/northsydney?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Brisbane Campus</strong></a><br/><span>Level 3, 119 Charlotte Street</span><br/><span>Brisbane QLD 4000</span><br/><span>+</span><span>61 7 3040 4417</span> </p> <p> </p><p><a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/gold-coast?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Gold Coast Campus</strong></a><br/>56 Nerang Street<br/><span>Southport Gold Coast QLD 4215 </span><br/><span>+61 7 5606 7133</span></p> <p></p> <p> </p><p><a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/perth?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Perth Campus</strong></a><br/><span>13 Beechboro Road South</span><br/><span>Bayswater WA 6053 </span><br/><span>+61 8 6187 9625</span></p> <p></p> <p> </p><p><a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/your-campus/adelaide?hsLang=en-au"><strong>Adelaide Campus</strong></a><br/><span>Level 4, 27 Currie Street</span><br/><span>Adelaide SA 5000 </span><br/><span>+61 8 6333 0338</span></p> <p></p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span3"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy"> <!--English Course Menu Start --> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/general-english-course?hsLang=en-au" rel="nofollow"> English Courses </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/general-english-course?hsLang=en-au"> General English </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/english-pronunciation-course?hsLang=en-au"> Pronunciation in Context </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/ielts-preparation-courses?hsLang=en-au"> IELTS Preparation </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/cambridge-exam-preparation-courses?hsLang=en-au"> Cambridge Exam Preparation </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/business-english-course?hsLang=en-au"> English for Business </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/english-for-academic-purposes-eap?hsLang=en-au"> English for Academic Purposes </a> </li> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/english-courses/english-vocational-studies-evs?hsLang=en-au"> English for Vocational Studies (EVS) </a> </li> </ul> <!-- English Course Menu End --> <!-- Young Learner Start --> <ul> <li> <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/studygroup?hsLang=en-au"> Study Groups - Global Explorer </a> </li> </ul> <!-- Young 