loma-program-management&amp;ts=1782479342785&amp;__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;contentType=standard-page" id="cta_button_493380_08de26ea-8796-41b6-a4e0-7f9351d35137" style="" title="DOWNLOAD GUIDE">DOWNLOAD GUIDE</a></span><script charset="utf-8" src="/hs/cta/cta/current.js"></script><script type="text/javascript"> hbspt.cta._relativeUrls=true;hbspt.cta.load(493380, ''''c27d4c31-fe54-406f-aca3-fab27455ab6a'''', {"useNewLoader":"true","region":"na1"}); </script></span><!-- end HubSpot Call-to-Action Code --></span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-2 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_dnd_area-module-2" style=""> <section class="heading-content" id="whyGreenwich"> <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Lead and manage programs to successful completion</p> <p>Programs are large scale projects made up of several projects that are dependant on each other. Outlining objectives, planning execution, managing operations, and reporting on status are just a few of the functions involved in carrying out a successful program.Gain the knowledge and the skills to delegate projects appropriately and deliver programs that impact business growth.</p> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1686908168205" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span7 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Who is this course for?</p> <p>Advanced Diploma of Program Management is best suited for people who have experience in a project management role and are seeking to enhance their program management skills to further their career.</p> <p>This course will provide students with a solid foundation in Program Management across a range of industry contexts. Individuals at this level use initiative and judgement to direct, plan and lead a range of program functions.</p> <p>A program is defined as a set of interrelated projects, each of which has a Project Manager. A ‘program’ of projects refers to a number of related projects managed by the same person.</p> <p>You will also have the opportunity to study for a globally recognised Project Management certification for <strong>FREE</strong>. Exclusive to Greenwich College students, save $1200 and join our <a href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hubfs/2022/CAPM%20CERTIFICATION%20-%20PREP%20COURSE.pdf?hsLang=en-au" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><strong>Certified Associate in Project Management</strong></a> (CAPM) certification preparation course.</p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1686908168205_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span5 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681177863860" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span6 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;"><span style="color: #000000;">What you will learn:</span></p> <p style="line-height: 1.5;"><strong>BSBSTR601</strong> Manage innovation and continuous improvement<br/><strong>BSBPEF502</strong> Develop and use emotional intelligence<br/><strong>BSBPMG633</strong> Provide leadership for the program<br/><strong>BSBPMG634</strong> Facilitate stakeholder engagement (core)<br/><strong>BSBPMG637</strong> Engage in collaborative alliances<br/><strong>BSBTWK503</strong> Manage meetings<br/><strong>BSBLDR601</strong> Lead and manage organisational change<br/><strong>BSBPMG630</strong> Enable program execution (core)<br/><strong>BSBPMG635</strong> Implement program governance (core)<br/><strong>BSBPMG636</strong> Manage benefits (core)<br/><strong>BSBPMG631</strong> Manage program delivery<br/><strong>BSBPMG632</strong> Manage program risk</p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681177863860_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span6 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681178096566" style=""> <section class="small-icon-module"> <div class="container"> <div class="small-icon-quick-info"> <div class="heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">You will learn this through</p> </div> <ul class="small-learn-icon"> <li> <p> </p><p>Audio</p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Presentations</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Social Media</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Role Play</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Online</span></p> <p></p> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895" style=""> <section class="span12 features-listnew"> <div class="span12 gwcFeatures"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionHead alignCenter heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Why Study Your Advanced Diploma of Program Management at Greenwich College?</p> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid sectioncol"> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/IndustryExpertTrainers_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=IndustryExpertTrainers_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Developed in <br/>consultation</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul style="list-style-type: square;"> <li> <p>Expert trainers with extensive industry experience and regular professional development – to better prepare you for a career in Project Management.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/PracticalCaseStudies_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=PracticalCaseStudies_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Practical case studies <br/>to strengthen learning</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul style="list-style-type: square;"> <li> <p>Greenwich Management College’s Advanced Diploma of Program Management features extensive use of real-life case studies to support learning, delivering valuable insights and applications to Australian business.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/FunInteractiveClassesOPTION2_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=FunInteractiveClassesOPTION2_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Fun &amp; interactive<br/>classes</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul style="list-style-type: square;"> <li> <p>Classes are fun and interactive involving practical activities and the opportunity for students to share ideas, test their thinking and examine different perspectives on issues.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">More options for<br/>further study</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul style="list-style-type: square;"> <li> <p>Gain direct entry to leading Australian Universities and Colleges and receive credits towards related study – without having to complete an entry exam.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Flexible<br/>timetable options</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <p>Choose from weekday evening or weekend classes - so you can work and experience the best of Australia while you study.</p> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/FreeAcademicSupport_360x430_1.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=FreeAcademicSupport_360x430_1.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Learning support</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-program-management?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.16.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul style="list-style-type: square;"> <li> <p>Access to 10 hours of learning support per week, for those who need it.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680241117895_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-11 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680758690704" style=""> <section class="span12 need-to-know sectionPadding needtoknow"> <div class="span12 need-to-know gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-header sectionHead"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Here''''s what you need to know</p> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 need-to-know"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Course Commencement</strong><br/>There are 6 intakes per year.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent1'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent1'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Course Duration</strong><br/>The courses run for 76 weeks, with adjustments for Christmas breaks.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent2'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent2'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Entry Requirements</strong><br/>Display entry requirements</p> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-angle-down" id="displayContent3"></i> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent3'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent3'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent1" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent2" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent3" style="display: none;"> <p><strong>Entry Requirement</strong></p> <span></span> <ul> <li>All students must be 18 years or older at the commencement of their course</li> </ul> <p><strong>English Language Requirement</strong></p> <span></span> <ul> <li>All students must have a minimum English language proficiency of IELTS 5.5 or equivalent <strong>OR</strong></li> <li>Have successfully completed one of the following courses with Greenwich English College: General English (Upper Intermediate Level 8 weeks*), English for Business (12 weeks), Cambridge PET * FCE and CAE, EVS, EAP and IELTS* (*With exit point of 5.5 or higher)</li> <li>Direct entry to students on passing Greenwich English College Placement Test (online and<span> </span><g data-gr-id="13" id="13">on campus</g><span> </span>testing options</li> </ul> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="rich_text" data-x="0"> <div> <p><strong>Academic Requirement</strong></p> <span data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"> </span> <p>Entry to this qualification is limited to those individuals who:</p> <ul> <li>Have completed a Diploma of Project Management qualification. <strong>OR</strong></li> <li>Have completed two years equivalent full-time relevant<span> </span><g data-gr-id="15" id="15">workplace</g><span> </span>experience at a significant level within a project or program environment within an enterprise.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="global_group" data-x="0"> <div data-global-widget-path="generated_global_groups/3910102441.html"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="header" data-x="0"> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div> </div> </div> </main> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17616307527712" style=""><div class="footer-wrapper"> <div class="footer-grid"> <!-- Column 1: Logo and Social --> <div class="footer-column footer-logo-social" id="footer-logo"> <p class="footer-h2" style="font-weight:bold;">Stay Connected</p> <div class="social-icons-footer"> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/greenwichcollege/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a> <a href="https://www.facebook.com/GreenwichCollege/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-facebook-f"></i></a> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/school/greenwich-college/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></a> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCcatEHZzcyXn6kTy19exfSA" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-youtube"></i></a> </div> <ul class="social-icons head"> </ul> </div> <!-- Column 2–3: Locations --> <div class="footer-column footer-locations footer-dropdown" id="footer-locations"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Campus Locations</p> <div class="footer-dropdown-content location-columns"> <div class="location-group"> <p><strong>Sydney Pitt St Campus</strong><br/>Level 2, 396 Pitt Street<br/>Sydney NSW 2000<br/>📞 +61 2 9264 2223</p> <p><strong>Sydney Mary St Campus</strong><br/>Level 2, 72 Mary Street<br/>Sydney NSW 2000<br/>📞 +61 2 8317 0502</p> <p><strong>Melbourne Campus</strong><br/>Level 8, 120 Spencer Street<br/>Melbourne VIC 3000<br/>📞 +61 2 8609 0000</p> <p><strong>Brisbane Campus</strong><br/>Level 3, 119 Charlotte Street<br/>Brisbane QLD 4000<br/>📞 +61 7 3040 4417</p> </div> <div class="location-group"> <p><strong>Gold Coast Campus</strong><br/>56 Nerang Street<br/>Southport Gold Coast QLD 4215<br/>📞 +61 7 5606 7133</p> <p><strong>Perth Campus</strong><br/>13 Beechboro Road South<br/>Bayswater WA 6053<br/>📞 +61 8 6187 9625</p> <p><strong>Adelaide Campus</strong><br/>Level 4, 27 Currie Street<br/>Adelaide SA 5000<br/>📞 +61 8 6333 0338</p> </div> </div> </div> <!-- Column 4: Courses & Links --> <div class="footer-column footer-links"> <div class="footer-column footer-