loma-leadership-management%2F&amp;ts=1782479348543&amp;__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;contentType=standard-page" id="cta_button_493380_08de26ea-8796-41b6-a4e0-7f9351d35137" style="" title="DOWNLOAD GUIDE">DOWNLOAD GUIDE</a></span><script charset="utf-8" src="/hs/cta/cta/current.js"></script><script type="text/javascript"> hbspt.cta._relativeUrls=true;hbspt.cta.load(493380, ''''c27d4c31-fe54-406f-aca3-fab27455ab6a'''', {"useNewLoader":"true","region":"na1"}); </script></span><!-- end HubSpot Call-to-Action Code --></span> </div> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-2 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_dnd_area-module-2" style=""> <section class="heading-content" id="whyGreenwich"> <div class="container"> <div class="row"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Become a next generation business leader</p> <p><span>The Advanced Diploma of Leadership and Management provides you with the knowledge and initiative to lead your company, your business or your team from the front, and guide them to success. You will learn pivotal attributes that will help you recruit, train, shape and manage your teams and colleagues all the way to the top of your field.</span></p> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681179321642" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span7 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Who is this course for?</p> <p style="text-align: justify;">Advanced Diploma of Leadership and Management is designed for students looking to develop a senior management skill set and leadership attributes across a range of areas, including business administration and management, general administration and business communication. Students will learn leadership and management strategies and techniques to help them excel in the work place, including how to develop organisational strategies, how to create business development plans and how to lead and manage organisational change.<br/><br/>To enable an accelerated path to a chosen career, students will be at the cutting edge of human resources, company innovation and learn how to communicate with influence. <br/><br/><strong>There is no direct entry into this course. Students are required to complete a Diploma course with a BSB code as a pre-requisite.</strong><br/><br/><strong>Here are available Greenwich Management College BSB Diploma course options: </strong><br/><a href="/management-courses/diploma-business-digital-transformation?hsLang=en-au" rel="noopener"><strong>Diploma of Business | Digital Transformation (BSB50120)</strong></a><br/><a href="/management-courses/diploma-marketing-communication?hsLang=en-au" rel="noopener"><strong>Diploma of Marketing and Communication (BSB50620)</strong></a><br/><a href="/management-courses/diploma-of-leadership-management?hsLang=en-au" rel="noopener"><strong>Diploma of Leadership and Management (BSB50420)</strong></a><br/><a href="/management-courses/diploma-project-management?hsLang=en-au" rel="noopener"><strong>Diploma of Project Management (BSB50820)</strong></a></p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681179321642_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span5 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681179826274" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span6 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;"><span style="color: #000000;">You will learn to</span></p> <p><strong>BSBCRT611</strong> - Apply critical thinking for complex problem solving (Core)<br/><strong>BSBLDR601</strong> - Lead and manage organisational change (Core)<br/><strong>BSBLDR602</strong> - Provide leadership across the organisation (Core)<br/><strong>BSBOPS601</strong> - Develop and implement business plans (Core)<br/><strong>BSBSTR601</strong> - Manage innovation and continuous improvement (Core)<br/><strong>BSBPEF501</strong> - Manage personal and professional development<br/><strong>BSBPMG633</strong> - Provide leadership for the program<br/><strong>BSBSTR602</strong> - Develop organisational strategies<br/><strong>BSBPMG637</strong> - Engage in collaborative alliance<br/><strong>BSBSUS601</strong> - Lead corporate social responsibility</p> <p><strong>Career Opportunities:</strong><br/>Operations Manager, Business Manager/Owner, Senior Management, Change Implementation Manager, HR Manager, Team Leader/Manager, Executive Manager, Area Manager, Business Development Manager, Departmental Manager and more...</p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681179826274_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span6 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1681180229521" style=""> <section class="small-icon-module"> <div class="container"> <div class="small-icon-quick-info"> <div class="heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">You will learn this through</p> </div> <ul class="small-learn-icon"> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Audio</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Presentations</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Social Media</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Role Play</span></p> <p></p> </li> <li> <p> </p><p><span>Online</span></p> <p></p> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394" style=""> <section class="span12 features-listnew"> <div class="span12 gwcFeatures"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionHead alignCenter heading"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Why Study Your Diploma of Project Management at Greenwich College?</p> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid sectioncol"> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-887448060-3.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=836&amp;name=iStock-887448060-3.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Developed in Consultation</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Expert trainers with extensive industry experience and regular professional development – to better prepare you for a career in Project Management.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/iStock-902440746-2.jpg?width=1254&amp;height=837&amp;name=iStock-902440746-2.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Practical case studies to strengthen learning</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Greenwich Management College’s Diploma of Project Management features extensive use of real-life case studies to support learning, delivering valuable insights and applications to Australian business.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/20240419_115933.jpg?width=2000&amp;height=1500&amp;name=20240419_115933.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Fun &amp; interactive classes</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Classes are fun and interactive involving practical activities and the opportunity for students to share ideas, test their thinking and examine different perspectives on issues.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreOptionsFurtherStudy_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">More options for further study</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Gain direct entry to leading Australian Universities and Colleges and receive credits towards related study – without having to complete an entry exam.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=MoreFlexibility_360x430.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Flexible timetable options</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <p>Choose from weekday evening or weekend classes - so you can work and experience the best of Australia while you study.</p> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 featureContentWrap2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frnt2" style=''''background-image: url("https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/hs-fs/hubfs/05Hold_Images_New_Site/Courses/WhyGreenwichIMages/FreeAcademicSupport_360x430_1.jpg?width=360&amp;height=430&amp;name=FreeAcademicSupport_360x430_1.jpg");''''> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frntImg"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 frontCopy"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Learning support</p> <p> <a class="cta_button pinkCTAsmall" href="https://www.greenwichcollege.edu.au/management-courses/advanced-diploma-leadership-management/?__hstc=122107220.53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4.1782479250262.1782479250262.1782479250262.1&amp;__hssc=122107220.17.1782479250262&amp;__hsfp=1921dd05a39ef67f80eb4e0098c0787f&amp;hsutk=53440f58d7e47852acc26b0b32fa98f4&amp;contentType=standard-page"> Read More </a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 bck2"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 sectionCopy hover_section_part"> <div class="alignCenter"> <span class="hover-icon"></span> </div> <ul> <li> <p>Access to an 10 hours of learning support per week, for those who need it.</p> </li> </ul> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680255279394_" style=""></span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-11 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1680759778789" style=""> <section class="span12 need-to-know sectionPadding needtoknow"> <div class="span12 need-to-know gwcContainer"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-header sectionHead"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="header" data-x="0"> <div> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Here''''s what you need to know</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div> <div> <div data-w="4" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0"> <div> <div> <div data-w="12" data-widget-type="linked_image" data-x="0"> <div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 need-to-know"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Course Commencement</strong><br/>There are 6 intakes per year.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent1'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent1'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Course Duration</strong><br/>The courses run for 76 weeks, with adjustments for Christmas breaks.</p> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent2'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent2'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="span4 need-to-know gwcNeedtoKnowThumb entryReq"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span"> <div class="span4img3"> </div> </div> </div> <div class=""> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 needtoknowdiv"> <div class="title"> <p><strong>Entry Requirements</strong><br/>Display entry requirementsp</p> <i aria-hidden="true" class="fa fa-angle-down" id="displayContent3"></i> </div> <script>$(''''#displayContent3'''').click(function() { $(''''.moreContent3'''').slideToggle(); }); </script> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent1" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent2" style="display: none;"> </div> </div> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span entryReq moreContent3" style="display: none;"> <strong>Entry Requirement</strong><br/> <ul> <li>All students must be 18 years or older at the commencement of their course</li> </ul> <strong>English Language Requirement</strong><br/> <ul> <li>All students must have a minimum English language proficiency of IELTS 5.5 or equivalent<span> </span><strong>OR</strong></li> <li>Have successfully completed one of the following courses with Greenwich English College: General English (Upper Intermediate Level 8 weeks*), English for Business (12 weeks), Cambridge PET * FCE and CAE, EVS, EAP and IELTS* (*With exit point of 5.5 or higher)</li> <li>Direct entry to students on passing Greenwich English College Placement Test (online and<span> </span><g data-gr-id="10" id="10">on campus</g><span> </span>testing options)</li> </ul> <strong>Academic Requirement</strong><br/> <ul> <li>Have completed a Diploma or Advanced Diploma from the BSB Training Package (current or superseded equivalent versions).<br/>or</li> <li>Have two years equivalent full-time relevant workplace experience in an operational or leadership role in an enterprise.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div> </div> </div> </main> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17616307527712" style=""><div class="footer-wrapper"> <div class="footer-grid"> <!-- Column 1: Logo and Social --> <div class="footer-column footer-logo-social" id="footer-logo"> <p class="footer-h2" style="font-weight:bold;">Stay Connected</p> <div class="social-icons-footer"> <a href="https://www.instagram.com/g