v class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-rich_text" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17380311323316" style=""><span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17380311323316_" style=""><p style="font-weight:bold;"><span style="color: #000000; font-size: 21px;">Cyber Security Management</span><span style="color: #000000;"></span></p> <p style="text-align: center;">Learn to protect sensitive data and information online. </p></span></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> <div class="span4 widget-span widget-type-cell cell_173803113233012-vertical-alignment dnd-column" data-w="4" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="8" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-11 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget module_17380311323319-flexbox-positioning dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-linked_image" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17380311323319" style=""> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_linked_image" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="linked_image" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17380311323319_" style=""></span></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-12 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-rich_text" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_173803113233110" style=""><span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text" id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_173803113233110_" style=""><p style="font-weight:bold;"><span style="color: #000000;">Network Engineering</span></p> <p style="text-align: center;">Manage logistics across telecommunication network projects. </p></span></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-13 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-14 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1703222601353" style=""> <section class="gwcMoreSupport"> <div class="container"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span6 content"> <p style="font-weight:bold;">Who is this course for?</p> <ul style="line-height: 1;"> <li> <h4><span style="color: #666666; font-family: ''''Trebuchet MS'''', Geneva, Tahoma, sans-serif;"><strong>Anyone looking to further their skills and knowledge</strong> in Information Technology.</span></h4> </li> <li> <h4><span style="color: #666666; font-family: ''''Trebuchet MS'''', Geneva, Tahoma, sans-serif;"><strong>Individuals with relevant IT experience</strong> who aspire to lead and advance in their careers.</span></h4> </li> <li> <h4><span style="color: #666666; font-family: ''''Trebuchet MS'''', Geneva, Tahoma, sans-serif;">Those eager to study a <strong>nationally recognised course</strong> to gain qualifications and enhance their career opportunities in the IT industry.</span></h4> </li> </ul> <p><strong>DURATION: </strong><span></span>12 terms- Each term includes 6 weeks of study plus 2 weeks holidays</p> <p>Choose from Sydney, Melbourne, Gold Coast, or Adelaide</p> <p> </p> <span></span> <p> </p> <div class="hs-cta-node"> <span class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_cta" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="cta" id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1703222601353_" style=""></span> </div> </div> <div class="span6 image"> </div> </div> </div> </section> <div class="testimonial-modal modal" id="testimonial_modal"> <div class="modal-dialog"> <!-- Modal content--> <div class="modal-content"> <div class="modal-body"> <div class="banner-video_pop"> </div> </div> <div class="modal-footer"> <button class="close">X</button> </div> </div> </div> </div></div> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> </div><!--end widget-span --> </div><!--end row--> </div><!--end row-wrapper --> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-15 dnd-section"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" data-w="12" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-16 dnd-row"> <div class="row-fluid"> <div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" data-w="12" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" style=""> <div class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module" id="h